          "right": {
            "aggregate_kind": "MAX",
            "list": {
              "list": { "list_elements": "e3" },
              "filter": {
                "left": { "attribute_name": "nationality", "of": "e3" },
                "operator": "=",
                "right": "Argentine"
              }
            },
            "map_expression": { "attribute_name": "salary", "of": "e3" }
          }
        },
        "quantifier_kind": "ALL"
      }
    }
  }
]
```
One final check: `r1` is a relationship. The `filter` on the list of `e2` must refer to its connection to `e1`.

